bsite Builder\">\n                                </div><div class=\"carousel-item\">\n                                    <img class=\"d-block w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/316969927-491020836178175-4044676898591507964-n-18264081703110636-1179x2096.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n                                </div><div class=\"carousel-item\">\n                                    <img class=\"d-block w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/317012605-3497337253830024-2356045067737969231-n-17965822859071494-1179x2096.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n                                </div><div class=\"carousel-item\">\n                                    <img class=\"d-block w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/317189198-676815414090938-5125507918297223057-n-17950090604510004-1179x2096.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <ol class=\"carousel-indicators\">\n                                <li data-target=\"#lb-{{idGallery}}\" data-slide-to=\"0\" class=\"active\" data-bs-slide-to=\"0\"></li><li data-target=\"#lb-{{idGallery}}\" data-slide-to=\"1\" class data-bs-slide-to=\"1\"></li><li data-target=\"#lb-{{idGallery}}\" data-slide-to=\"2\" class data-bs-slide-to=\"2\"></li><li data-target=\"#lb-{{idGallery}}\" data-slide-to=\"3\" class data-bs-slide-to=\"3\"></li><li data-target=\"#lb-{{idGallery}}\" data-slide-to=\"4\" class data-bs-slide-to=\"4\"></li><li data-target=\"#lb-{{idGallery}}\" data-slide-to=\"5\" class data-bs-slide-to=\"5\"></li><li data-target=\"#lb-{{idGallery}}\" data-slide-to=\"6\" class data-bs-slide-to=\"6\"></li><li data-target=\"#lb-{{idGallery}}\" data-slide-to=\"7\" class data-bs-slide-to=\"7\"></li><li data-target=\"#lb-{{idGallery}}\" data-slide-to=\"8\" class data-bs-slide-to=\"8\"></li><li data-target=\"#lb-{{idGallery}}\" data-slide-to=\"9\" class data-bs-slide-to=\"9\"></li><li data-target=\"#l